		{
			"text": "To build a Nanoprogram, you first need to make a Programmed Photon Particle Emitter. The construction of this item require different ingredients depending of the Instruction Disc. In fact, to make it you need a Symbol Library. To know which one you need, just read the description of the Instruction Disc. In our case, it'll be a #L \"Symbol Library - Medical\" \"144796\". As for the Crystal Reflection Pattern (Medical one in this case)."
		}
